{"overview":"در دنیایی از شکارچیان با استعداد و هیولاها، یک شکارچی ضعیف به نام سونگ جین وو از طریق یک برنامه مرموز قدرت های خارق العاده ای به دست می آورد و او را به یکی از قوی ترین شکارچیان تبدیل می کند و حتی قوی ترین سیاه چال ها را فتح می کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"They say whatever doesn’t kill you makes you stronger, but that’s not the case for the world’s weakest hunter Sung Jinwoo. After being brutally slaughtered by monsters in a high-ranking dungeon, Jinwoo came back with the System, a program only he could see, that’s leveling him up in every way. Now, he’s inspired to discover the secrets behind his powers and the dungeon that spawned them.","tagline_en":"He used to be the weakest.","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2024,"poster":"/hUQRnwRuVtz0CRZhUiOA26gXRoU.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2024,"poster":"/rL0r1e8oI8GmgFHW3Woon6RPpkh.jpg"}],"episodes":25,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","KR","US"],"cast":[{"name":"坂泰斗","role":"Shun Mizushino (voice)","photo":"/pSExEOVmjAujKUyJJJSxC1WEzOM.jpg","en":"Taito Ban"},{"name":"中村源太","role":"Kenta Morobishi (voice)","photo":"/bl3pu2fsaNfHqnZQSDugY4V1CE0.jpg","en":"Genta Nakamura"},{"name":"三川華月","role":"Aoi Mizushino (voice)","photo":"/nsrFjmDDzo4FDMhxyvuVk4mPEH3.jpg","en":"Haruna Mikawa"},{"name":"上田麗奈","role":"Shizuku Kousaka (voice)","photo":"/2WV61uVU7y6XGYqNHLMpP0sApdu.jpg","en":"Reina Ueda"},{"name":"平川大輔","role":"Shin Mogami (voice)","photo":"/8uDi5NxFdxFvfVyo4n5CeOSLWEf.jpg","en":"Daisuke Hirakawa"},{"name":"東地宏樹","role":"Taiga Shirakawa (voice)","photo":"/bU2vogWmnTWiQEwUADWlnBqAPhJ.jpg","en":"Hiroki Touchi"},{"name":"銀河万丈","role":"Kiyoomi Goto (voice)","photo":"/qiXnKaZheMiVyA1U2mX9tPdNA3T.jpg","en":"Banjo Ginga"},{"name":"古川慎","role":"Akira Inukai (voice)","photo":"/inLmBZhrqXeE9wlViyK28ocKJSw.jpg","en":"Makoto Furukawa"}],"trailer":"HkIKAnwLZCw","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/127532/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyr